WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

c001
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.087
A second person in a light outfit joins the bald person in a doorway.

c002
00:00:18.349 --> 00:00:20.671
The two people are surrounded by wires.

c005
00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:45.847
Wire figures hang nearby as the two walk on the walkway.

c007
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.784
Wire figures move around the two as they walk side by side.

c008
00:00:57.315 --> 00:01:00.659
The wire figures climb along a curved metal pipe structure.

c011
00:01:12.459 --> 00:01:15.338
The two stand on a small platform and look around.

c012
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.021
The bald person gestures toward the wires while speaking to the other person.

c013
00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:26.932
The two people climb onto the wires and move through the dark space.
